      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here are a few challenging customer profiles for your training manual. The \"Impulsive Browser\" is overly inquisitive and might try to probe for sales tactics, so your staff should be friendly yet firm, maintaining professional distance. The \"High-Value Complainer\" is demanding and overly critical, requiring active listening and empathetic de-escalation before offering solutions. Finally, the \"Time-Sensitive Bargainer\" approaches with immediate demands for discounts, needing a calm tone while adhering strictly to company pricing policies.",
